OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain in the morning, turning more
OL,7,Fshowery in the early afternoon, some
OL,8,Fof the showers may be on the heavy
OL,9,Fside. Some brighter spells developing
OL,10,Flater in the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome showers at first,
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy, but these soon
OL,14,Ffading out. Otherwise it will stay dry
OL,15,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,16,Fsome sunny then clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
