OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry in the morning with some
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Staying dry and bright
OL,7,Fin the east in the afternoon, but
OL,8,Fcloudier in the west with the odd
OL,9,Flight shower possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FAn
OL,12,Funsettled and changeable period with
OL,13,Fthe risk of rain or showers, rain
OL,14,Fpossibly heavy at times but feeling
OL,15,Fwarm in any sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
